  "solution": "**Symbol**\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/94a3ba98fe537b71a0cedca8cdf679aea0668b950fa8b6ddc2ea6c6e99a6adff.png] \n\nAfter replacing the symbols by their meaning, we get:\n\n1. 10 + 3 - 2 × 9 ÷ 2 = 21\n\n2. __**20 ÷**____** 4**__ × 6 - 9 + 4 = 25\n\n⇒ __**5**____** ×**____** 6**__ - 9 + 4 = 25\n\n⇒ __**30**__ - 9 __**+ 4**__ = 25\n\n⇒ 34 - 9 = 25\n\n⇒ 25 = 25\n\n3. 10 ÷ 2 + 3 ÷ 9 × 2 = 8\n\n4. 20 + 6 - 4 × 9 ÷ 6 = 32\n\nHence, ‘**20 - 4 + 6 ÷ 9 × 4 = 25**’ is the correct answer.",
